WEBVTT

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:03.850
Let go!

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.320
I said, let go!

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:07.170
Bitch!

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:07.880
Captain.

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:09.950
Raptor-1 has been seized.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:13.550
I've also brought along the witness, Daimon Masaru.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:15.180
Hey!

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.250
Agumon should've been cleared of suspicion already!

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.710
Stop treating him like a criminal!

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:22.320
That's not what this is about!

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.100
Then what?!

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:27.300
Digimon aren't supposed to be coming in this world to begin with!

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.570
Just being with humans is a crime!

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.420
A crime?!

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.740
But you guys have Digimon with you, too!

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:39.910
If a patrol car speeds to catch a speeding car, that doesn't make the patroller a criminal, does it?

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.330
Oh...

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.860
Aniki, get a hold of yourself!

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.500
Satsuma, what must be done with Raptor-1?

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.710
Digimon who cause problems in the human world...

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:56.050
must be completely reduced to a Digiegg and forcibly sent back to the Digital World.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:58.390
A Digiegg?

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:01.050
That's...!

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:15.440
Coordinate axes are set!

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:18.260
Cooling of transmission equipment on!

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.530
Bionic Condenser functioning!

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:23.470
Digital Harmonizer aligning!

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:25.880
Security opening!

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.500
Digital Gate Open!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:32.040
5 seconds to transfer!

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:33.790
3...

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:34.800
2...

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.010
1...

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:37.900
Begin transportation!

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:38.840
Beginning transportation!

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:43.640
Wh-What's that?

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.590
Transfer complete!

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:57.650
It disappeared...

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:01.540
We simply sent it back to the Digital World, where the Digimon live.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:03.740
Now, it's Raptor-1's turn.

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:09.040
Aniki, help me!

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:11.760
What are you doing to my follower?!

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.800
Agumon, let's split!

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:21.840
'Kay!

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:27.080
You're not getting away!

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:32.940
A Digivice?

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:35.950
Does it belong to that boy?

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:38.770
I see.

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:40.020
That man must've...

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.640
They were connected to a place like this...

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:49.080
Aniki, let's hurry out of here!

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:49.830
I-Idiot!

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.960
You'll stand out too much if you leave like this!

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.210
There must be something I can...

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:56.770
There!

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:03.010
Okay!

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:10.600
Hey Aniki, how far are we going?

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:11.910
Shh!

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.430
Just be quiet and follow me.

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:19.150
I'm hungry!

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:31.760
Aniki, this stuff is pretty good!

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:35.680
What was that crap about only eating "food made for Digimon?"

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:37.460
He eats anything!

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:38.820
Masaru?

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:39.420
Are you here?

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.020
Hide!

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:43.880
Hurry up!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.350
Aniki...!

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:47.930
Masaru!

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.900
M-Mom!

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:50.800
I'm back!

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:53.900
Really, where were you last night?

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:59.070
I thought you got into trouble with the police again! I was so worried!

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.310
N-Not at all!

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:04.740
My friends and I just started talking about life...

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:07.220
And before I knew it, it was morning!

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.780
Masaru...

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:13.050
Wh-What?!

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:15.540
You're stepping on chocolate.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.500
I-I didn't notice!

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:20.940
Your room is so messy!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.620
I-I'll clean it up right now,

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:24.770
s-so leave me to it, okay?

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:31.140
Aniki, what was that for?!

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:36.270
If anyone finds out you're here, they'll come to drag you back!

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:38.980
I don't want that!

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:41.150
Then listen to me,

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:43.500
and don't ever make any sounds, okay?

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:44.640
Okay!

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:45.110
Also...

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:45.820
Masaru?

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:51.180
I thought I heard you talking to someone...

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.290
A-Ah, well...!

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:55.170
I-It's just your imagination!

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:56.830
Are you hiding something?

00:04:57.910 --> 00:04:59.410
N-No, nothing!

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:01.370
Look at me when you're talking!

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:04.010
Masaru, remember our promise?

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:09.530
That until your father comes back, the three of us will tell each other everything!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.500
Three?

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:25.000
What's wrong, Chika?

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.990
I saw a huge lizard!

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:27.960
Lizard?

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:30.530
W-W-Wait a sec-...!!

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:33.400
There's nothing here.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:34.620
I saw it!

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.300
A giant lizard, right there!

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:45.280
It must be an UMA!

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:50.930
NOTE: UMA = Unidentified Mysterious Animal

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:50.930
An unidentified life form just like Nessie or the Abominable Snowman!

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:54.480
Now... where did I put my video camera?

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:56.890
What's that?

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:00.280
It must be that lizard!

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:02.160
Chika!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:03.610
Wait a second!

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:05.650
It's dangerous, so stay back!

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:06.510
I'll go...!

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.310
Masaru-niichan?!

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:24.040
NOTE: <i>Niichan</i> (兄ちゃん) is a term of endearment to an older brother.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.250
This is Yoshino.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:28.080
Target has been secured.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:30.930
I'll return to HQ right after I've erased their memories.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.890
Burn, Digisoul of Anger!

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:39.580
Burn, Digisoul of Anger

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:39.580
Flymon, Lurking in the Darkness

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.470
Flymon, Lurking in the Darkness!

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:42.990
Agumon!

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.200
Oww...

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:46.590
Agumon!

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:48.040
Where'd you go, Agumon?!

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.320
Agumon!

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:53.640
Mom, where's Agumon?!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:58.610
Seconds, please!

00:07:58.610 --> 00:07:59.710
Coming right up!

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:04.150
How can you be so easygoing, eating like that?!

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:07.090
Because Sayuri said I could!

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.910
Don't call my mom by her first name!

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.530
Th-That hurts!

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:12.330
Hey!

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:16.020
We're in the middle of a meal. Do you mind keeping it down?

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.660
Ma'am, this kushikatsu is incredible!

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.660
NOTE: <i>Kushikatsu</i> (串カツ) is fried pork and vegetables on a skewer.

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:24.120
What are you doing here?

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.300
I don't know either!

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:28.650
I <i>was</i>  going to take you two in, but...

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.040
That won't be necessary.

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:34.550
Erasing the memories of Daimon Masaru and his family is canceled.

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:39.220
Yoshino, stay there and keep Raptor-1 under surveillance.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:40.340
Understood?

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:41.610
B-But wait...!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.690
So that's why...

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:49.720
I'll be freeloading off of you here for a while.

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:50.960
What?!

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.700
No freaking way! Leave right now!

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:54.650
I can't.

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:56.310
I'm under Captain's orders.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:58.060
When I say leave, you leave!

00:08:58.060 --> 00:08:59.730
I won't!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.500
Stop arguing like an old married couple.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.040
Who are you calling a couple?!

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.040
Who are you calling a couple?!

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:09.910
Aniki...

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.670
I can't eat anymore...

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:13.420
Goddamn it...

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:16.000
Gimme a break!

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.730
Oh, no...

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:18.340
Hamburgers... potato chips...

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.250
Aniki, where are you going?

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:44.120
School.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.100
What's a school?

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:49.830
A place where there are tons of people to fight against.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.470
Wow!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:54.000
I'll go too, Aniki!

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:56.110
All right then, let's go!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.420
Have you forgotten?

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:00.970
If a Digimon is seen in public, it'll cause an uproar!

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:02.700
Oh yeah...

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:06.190
I wanna go to school with Aniki!

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:08.540
I wanna go! I wanna go!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.060
Fine, have it your way.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.270
Here, use this.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:13.570
This...

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:15.530
I thought I lost it!

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:17.870
You left it at DATS yesterday.

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.700
Oh, thanks!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:21.760
So what do I do now?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:24.970
Point that towards Agumon and press the button on the right.

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:27.740
Like this?

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:34.030
Aniki! What is this?!

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:35.000
Let me out!

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.210
Agumon!

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:40.550
The Digivice can change Digimon into data and store it away.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:44.680
Use that feature whenever you want to go anywhere together.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.750
Masaru, you're going to be late!

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:48.860
Crap!

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:49.950
I'm off!

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:57.290
How long are you gonna keep following me?

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:59.900
Until you surrender Agumon to me.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:02.200
Isn't there anything else I can do?

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:03.890
Let's see...

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.250
So there <i>is</i>  something?

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:07.550
You could join DATS.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:14.080
If you become DATS members, there'll be no reason for us to chase after Agumon.

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:18.840
I won't have to look over you guys either,

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:21.100
but I guess that'll never happen.

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:22.340
Of course not!

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:26.180
What's this?

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.180
Hey, aren't you pressed for time?

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:34.140
This is Chika's school.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:35.360
Geez...

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:40.930
Chika!

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:42.780
Masaru-niichan!

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:46.280
Look!

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:49.480
That's terrible...

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:54.990
Takashi-kun is the one in charge of taking care of the animals...

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:59.990
But when he came to give them breakfast today, all of the chickens and rabbits were dead!

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:04.870
Actually, there's been a series of earlier cases like this.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:08.810
A number of the victims came from the elementary school in the next town.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.080
Come with me.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:11.980
Wh-What?

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:16.770
A Digimon did that.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:18.480
Really?!

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:19.840
Look.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.940
You can see my Digivice reacting, right?

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:23.490
That means a Digimon was around here.

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:26.930
Whoa, it can do that too?

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:30.060
Things are getting interesting, Masaru-aniki!

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:30.660
Yeah!

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:33.660
Wait, what are you doing out here?!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:37.580
I couldn't get used to being inside that cramped Digivice!

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:40.370
Rare species like you are a real piece of work.

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:44.280
There aren't any Digimon who'd normally leave the Digivice on their own.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:49.760
Could it be you who attacked those pens?!

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:52.350
It's not him.

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:53.310
Lalamon?

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:57.620
While you were sleeping, I kept guard over him the whole night.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:00.070
Agumon didn't take a single step out of the room.

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:02.040
Another Digimon must've done it!

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:04.860
So, Aniki, that means...

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:06.210
Yeah!

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:09.530
We can give 'em a good thrashing once again!

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:13.410
Let's go, Takashi-kun.

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:14.830
Okay.

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:18.100
Chika!

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:24.590
We'll beat the crap out of the bastards who messed up those cages, okay?!

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:30.220
Got it.

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:31.160
Wait!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.350
What are you doing, Aniki?!

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:37.680
They say the criminal always returns to the scene of the crime, right?

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:42.610
When he finds out there's still prey inside here, I'm sure he'll strike again.

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:43.770
Wow!

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:46.060
You're so smart, Aniki!

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:49.650
That means he's making you bait for the enemy.

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:52.470
I'm bait?!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.260
Don't worry!

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:57.780
I'll beat 'im down before he does anything!

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:00.010
Will things really go that well?

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:06.010
I hate you, Aniki...

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:08.010
You even locked the door...

00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:24.260
Here he comes.

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:35.150
Isn't that Chika-chan's friend?

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:36.240
It's Takashi!

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:38.270
He's seen Agumon!

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.890
This is the worst!

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:41.460
Hey, Takashi!

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.780
What are you doing out so late?

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:47.920
Did you come to check on the cages?

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.510
Hey, say something!

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:53.470
Shut up!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.840
What was that?!

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:55.610
Wait!

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:56.890
Something's weird about him!

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:01.690
I... didn't want to take care of those animals!

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:05.940
I wished they would just disappear!

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:07.760
And then, this guy...

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:20.060
Takashi!

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:23.500
So he's the criminal!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:27.130
I'll kick your ass!

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.110
Stay back.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.080
What?

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:31.420
DATS will take over from here.

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:33.600
Lalamon!

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:34.590
Realize!

00:15:39.130 --> 00:15:41.820
La~la~mon!

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:43.600
Nuts Shoot!

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:56.110
Lalamon!

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:58.870
That creep!

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:00.210
Aniki!

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:01.900
Get me outta here first!

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:02.580
Okay!

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.470
Huh?

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:07.030
What was the combination again?

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:08.250
You can't open it?!

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:10.210
Lalamon, time to evolve!

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.800
Digisoul Charge!

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.750
Lalamon, evolve!

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:32.550
Sunflowmon!

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:40.470
Sunshine Beam!

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.120
All right!

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:49.140
Aw man, they got all the action because you're too slow!

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:49.750
What?!

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:59.800
No way... It's evolving!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.940
What is this?

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:25.650
My body's turning numb...

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.680
Now you've done it!

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:38.640
Aniki, I'm gonna evolve too!

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:39.670
Gotcha!

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:42.490
Huh?

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.170
What's wrong, Aniki?

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.510
I don't know!

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:48.790
I'm not getting that exploding, burning feeling!

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:55.310
Damn it!

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:56.680
Aniki!

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:03.990
I told you to stay back!

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:08.410
It's dangerous, so run away and leave the fighting to us!

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:10.170
Don't be stupid!

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:14.090
There's no way I'll turn my back on the enemy and run like a coward!

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:19.200
No matter how difficult it gets, I'll stand firm without taking a step back!

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.690
That's...

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:22.760
How a man should live!

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:37.030
It's here!

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.330
Want this?

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:44.690
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:44.690
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:41.030
Yeah!

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.700
Perfect!

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:49.650
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:49.650
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:48.190
Digisoul Charge!

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:51.760
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:51.760
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:55.380
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:55.380
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:55.300
Agumon, evolve!

00:18:55.380 --> 00:19:00.190
<b>kimi no jikan wo tokihanate!</b>

00:18:55.380 --> 00:19:00.190
<b>And liberate your time!</b>

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:04.150
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:04.150
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:07.440
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:07.440
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:12.710
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:12.710
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:10.590
GeoGreymon!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:18.510
<b>kimi wo yobu koe ga kokoro de hajiketara</b>

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:18.510
<b>When the voice that calls you bellows with the heart</b>

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:24.680
<b>subete ga hajimaru Believer!</b>

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:24.680
<b>That's when everything will begin, Believer!</b>

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:27.790
Mega Flame!

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.480
You got him!

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:38.210
Yeah!

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:45.110
So, your fist of fury awakens your Digisoul.

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:47.850
You're getting more interesting by the minute.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:50.810
You're the old man who gave me the Digivice!

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:56.270
This human world must be too small for you to swing around those fiery fists of yours.

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:57.740
How about it?

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:02.780
In the Digimon's world, you'll find plenty of formidable opponents to fight to your heart's content.

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:06.280
Plenty of formidable opponents...

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.250
Transfer complete!

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:18.770
But both the cages and the playground were destroyed...

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:22.420
It took all we could to cover up the incident.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:28.380
B-But we were able to capture the Digimon, and we erased Takashi-kun's memory...

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.340
So all's well that ends well, right?

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:31.380
Don't get full of yourself!

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:33.230
I-I'm sorry...

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:37.820
By the way... who's looking over Raptor-1 right now?

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:39.680
Well, actually...

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:45.820
What are you two doing here?

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:47.770
Please!

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:49.530
Let us join DATS!

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:51.290
Let us join!

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:52.370
What?

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:55.980
If we join DATS, you won't have to dispose of Agumon, right?

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:58.790
Very well.

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.490
Captain!

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:05.320
Daimon Masaru, I figured you would come to us one day.

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:07.260
And Agumon.

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:10.110
Starting today, you two will be accepted as members of DATS.

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:12.980
We did it, Aniki!

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:13.720
Yeah!

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:16.640
Now we can fight against as many strong guys as we want!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:19.030
W-Wait a minute!

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:27.480
Master, we'll be landing shortly.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.190
Thank you.

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:34.560
It's been a while since I've last seen it... Mom's homeland, Japan.

