He just suddenly shows up at DATS headquarters and gives me a big attitude!

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:46.050
I heard from Yoshino that he's a super-genius, good at sports...

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:49.560
And he's also a European noble. He's the complete opposite of you, Aniki!

